@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber
hide footbox

participant "Core Service\n(Business Logic)" as Core
participant "Sender Node\n(Node A)" as Sender
participant "Redis Cluster" as Redis
participant "Receiver Node\n(Node B)" as Receiver
participant "Angular Client" as Client
database "Oracle DB" as DB

Note over Client, Receiver: User đang kết nối vào Node B (Active Tab)

== Bước 1: Nghiệp vụ Gửi Tin ==
Core -> Sender: sendNotification(User="USER_01", Content="Approved")
activate Sender

Sender -> DB: INSERT INTO LH_NOTIFICATIONS
note right: Luôn lưu DB trước để an toàn

== Bước 2: Định Tuyến (Targeted Routing) ==
Sender -> Redis: GET "user_locations" "USER_01"
activate Redis
Redis --> Sender: Return "NODE_B"
deactivate Redis

alt User Offline (Return NULL)
    Sender -> Sender: Log "User offline", Stop.
else User Online (Found NODE_B)
    Sender -> Redis: PUBLISH "notifications:NODE_B" (Payload)
    
    activate Redis
    Redis -> Receiver: onMessage(Payload)
    deactivate Redis
    
    activate Receiver
    Receiver -> Receiver: localEmitters.get("USER_01")
    
    alt Emitter tồn tại
        Receiver -> Client: SSE Event: NEW_NOTIFICATION
        Client -> Client: Update UI & LocalStorage
    else Emitter null (Lỗi data rác)
        Receiver -> Receiver: Ignore & Cleanup Redis Location
    end
    deactivate Receiver
end

deactivate Sender
@enduml